<title>USA: Eastern Environmental Q3 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Eastern Environmental Q3 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>MT. LAUREL, N.J. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>				     1997	    1996	   1996</p>
<p>					     (Restated)  (As Previously</p>
<p>								    Reported)</p>
<p> Revenues			$19,512	$ 9,555	 $ 1,531</p>
<p> Merger costs		    1,480		0		 0</p>
<p> Net income (loss)		 362	   (55)	   (297)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per share</p>
<p>  Net income			0.02	 (0.01)	  (0.06)</p>
<p>  Operating income		0.13	 (0.01)	  (0.06)</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	  15,447	  9,118	   5,672</p>
<p>					   Nine Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>					1997	   1996	   1996</p>
<p>					     (Restated)  (As Previously</p>
<p>								    Reported)</p>
<p> Revenues			$52,409	$29,021	  $5,714</p>
<p> Merger costs		    3,337		0		 0</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	     (205)	  (541)	   (483)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per share</p>
<p>  Net income		    (0.02)	 (0.06)	  (0.09)</p>
<p>  Operating income		0.30	 (0.06)	  (0.09)</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	  13,317	  8,931	   5,485</p>
<p>		    (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Eastern Environmental Services Inc said its third quarter period ended March 31.</p>
<p>Operating income per share excludes merger costs and provisions for income taxes related to poolings of interests transactions.</p>
<p>The company said Apex Waste Services Inc and the Donno Co, which were acquired in the third quarter and accounted for under the poolings of interests method, contributed to the increased operating results.</p>
<p>Revenues for the third quarter of 1997 included $30 million from Apex Waste Services and the Donno Co.</p>
